      "writtenOn": "2020-06-03T02:29:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this margin fixed regardless of the type of barrel jack? (are there different barrel jack supplies? e.g. 90W vs. 65W?) Also, why do barrel jacks get 2W of margin? Is this some turbo thing?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 702,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 702,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "af4856daa1b9f58dd1d98e232e6a86e3b8574e55",
